"\"    var hop2 = new T.Mesh(new T.PlaneGeometry(5, 5), new T.MeshBasicMaterial({ color: new T.Color(0.4, 1.6, 1.7), side: T.DoubleSide })); hop2.position.set(-7, 3, -5); hop2.lookAt(0, 0, 0); s.add(hop2);\",",
